  "solution": "Concept:\n\nB = Bar/Bracket\n\nO = Off\n\nD = Division\n\nM = Multiplication\n\nA = Addition\n\nS = Subtraction\n\nCalculation:\n\n 7-1 (2)/(7) of 2 (1)/(3) ÷ (3)/(7) of (7)/(9)+3(2-(2)/(7) ÷ (3)/(7)right.of left.(1)/(3)) \n\n⇒ 7-(9)/(7) of (7)/(3) ÷ (3)/(7) of (7)/(9)+3(2-(2)/(7) ÷ (1)/(7)) \n\n⇒ 7-(9)/(7) of (7)/(3) ÷ (3)/(7) of (7)/(9)+3(2-(2)/(7) × (7)/(1)) \n\n⇒ 7-(9)/(7) of (7)/(3) ÷ (3)/(7) of (7)/(9)+3 × 0\n\n⇒ 7-3 ÷ (1)/(3) + 0\n\n⇒ 7 - 9 \n\n⇒ -2 \n\nThe answer is -2.\n\n201:Td",
